# POS · Sales · Sync

Read before editing:

- `.spec/features/pos.md`
- `.spec/features/sales.md`
- `.spec/features/sync.md`
- `.spec/system/plan-gating.md` (sales = professional; sync has no PlanLevel — known gap)
- `.spec/system/multi-tenancy.md`

Invariants:

- POS cobro → Dexie + syncQueue → `POST /sync/push` → `SalesService.create` — **not** `POST /sales` as the POS path
- Domain is `sales` / `SALE_*` — never `invoices` / `INVOICE_*`
- Sale update blocked when status not mutable (`SALE_001`)
- Sync push only meaningfully handles `sales` create; conflict resolve is metadata-only
- Auth tokens: JSON body + localStorage (not httpOnly cookies)
